Modification notice (GNU GPL v3, Section 5(a))
---------------------------------------------
Zycord is a modified version of Vencord. The Vencord source code was forked
and modified by Zynu for use in Zycord. Date of modification: 2026-11-24.

Zycord is a standalone Electron client for Windows. It opens https://discord.com
in its own application window and injects a forked, rebranded build of the
Vencord renderer. Zycord does not patch, modify, or redistribute the official
Discord desktop application.

